<template name="privacy"><view wx:if="{{privacyVisible}}" class="privacy-mask"><view class="privacy-box"><view class="label">请先了解隐私保护指引</view><view>所选图片的压缩副本会临时上传做微信内容安全检测，检测后删除。图纸在本机生成，保存时会请求相册写入权限。</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="privacyContract">阅读隐私保护指引</button><button id="privacy-agree" class="primary" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="privacyAgree">同意并继续</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="privacyDecline">暂不同意</button></view></view></template>
